WEBVTT

09:30.721 --> 09:32.723
I'm a coward.

09:33.933 --> 09:36.853
- My father always says so.
- The Wall's no place for cowards.

09:36.978 --> 09:38.980
You're right. I'm sorry.

09:39.105 --> 09:42.900
I just... wanted to thank you.

09:52.535 --> 09:54.829
A bloody coward.

09:54.954 --> 09:59.041
People saw us talking to him.
Now they'll think we're cowards too.

09:59.167 --> 10:00.918
You're too stupid to be a coward.
